      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue across the hallway and dispatch the guard walking around the pillar (4).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go north to the lever (2) and pull it. Rocks will fall, distracting the guard (5). Dispatch him and pull the lever (3).",
